cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CATS, please cite this repository."
title: "CATS: Compact Agent Tool Schema"
abstract: >-
  CATS is a compact notation for the tool (function) definitions sent to large
  language models in tool-calling APIs. Encoding a tool definition in CATS rather
  than JSON Schema reduces input tokens by a median of roughly 30% across the
  OpenAI, Qwen, and Anthropic tokenizers, with a small and model-dependent effect
  on tool-calling accuracy. This repository contains the format specification, a
  reference converter between JSON Schema and CATS, and the full evaluation.
type: software
